<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 64px', fontFamily: '"Source Han Sans SC", "Noto Sans SC", "PingFang SC", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif', background: '#F8FAFC' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6 0%, #06B6D4 100%)', borderRadius: 3 }} />
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>推荐流与采纳漏斗</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 4 }}>推荐得准不准，不能靠感觉——三级埋点把它变成可读的数字</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20, height: 520 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 512, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 14, padding: 12, boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)' }}>
        <Image src="assets/shots/p3_real_feed.png" style={{ width: 488, height: 339, borderRadius: 10, objectFit: 'cover', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 10, lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
          真实界面：当天仅 4 条命中垂类，卡片上依次是可用的领域、归一化热度、建议角度、来源与榜内名次，以及「用它做选题」入口。
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '10px 14px', justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#0F172A', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>推荐打分五因子（权重和 1.0）</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 6, marginTop: 7 }}>
          <Box style={{ flex: 3, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)', borderRadius: 6, padding: '5px 0', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>领域 .30</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 2.5, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '5px 0', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF' }}>新颖 .25</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 2, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '5px 0', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF' }}>覆盖 .20</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1.5, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '5px 0', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF' }}>热度 .15</Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '5px 0', alignItems: 'center' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#1E40AF' }}>可写 .10</Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
      <Box style={{ height: 272, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 14, padding: '12px 16px', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.06)' }}>
        <svg width="588" height="248" viewBox="0 0 588 248">
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="gF" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0">
              <stop offset="0%" stopColor="#3B82F6" />
              <stop offset="100%" stopColor="#06B6D4" />
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>

          <rect x="6" y="8" width="404" height="56" rx="9" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="32" fontSize="13.5" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">曝光 EXPOSE</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="52" fontSize="11" fill="#94A3B8">前端渲染完成后上报，按屏记条数 —— 这就是分母</text>

          <rect x="6" y="80" width="256" height="56" rx="9" fill="url(#gF)" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="104" fontSize="13.5" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">采纳 ADOPT</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="124" fontSize="11" fill="#E0F2FE">点「用它做选题」，带上点在第几名</text>

          <rect x="6" y="152" width="150" height="56" rx="9" fill="#0F172A" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="176" fontSize="13" fontWeight="bold" fill="#FFFFFF">出题 GENERATE</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="24" y="196" fontSize="10.5" fill="#94A3B8">仅服务端写入</text>

          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="278" y="104" fontSize="11.5" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">ctr = 采纳 ÷ 曝光</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="278" y="120" fontSize="10.5" fill="#64748B">推荐得准不准</text>

          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="172" y="176" fontSize="11.5" fontWeight="bold" fill="#0F172A">转化 = 出题 ÷ 采纳</text>
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="172" y="192" fontSize="10.5" fill="#64748B">选题好不好用</text>

          <line x1="6" y1="224" x2="582" y2="224" stroke="#E2E8F0" strokeWidth="1" />
          <text font-family="Microsoft YaHei, Source Han Sans SC, sans-serif" x="6" y="242" fontSize="10.5" fill="#94A3B8">无曝光时 ctr 返回空值而不是 0 —— 0 会被读成「没人点」，结论正好相反</text>
        </svg>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 14, padding: '14px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', boxShadow: '0 4px 20px rgba(15,23,42,0.05)' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>两个指标必须一起看</Text>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 10, marginTop: 8 }}>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 10px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6' }}>ctr 低于 5%</Text>
              ：推荐本身不准，该调五因子权重与领域词表。
            </Text>
          </Box>
          <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 8, padding: '8px 10px' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#334155', lineHeight: 1.65 }}>
              <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#3B82F6' }}>转化低于 50%</Text>
              ：推荐准了但题不好用，问题在选题质量而非排序。
            </Text>
          </Box>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
          只看 ctr 会把推荐调成标题党，只看转化会误判成排序问题。命中不足时我们不拿综合类补数——补进来的往往是时政与体育。
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 2, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #3B82F6, #06B6D4)' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>AI 自媒体内容创作助手 · 项目汇报</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>09 / 14</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
